# Normalize line endings to LF in the working tree on every platform. Without
# this, the Windows CI runner checks out CRLF. Its e2e leg runs pack.spec.ts,
# which splits test/fixtures/expected-pack.txt on a bare '\n', so every line but
# the last keeps a stray '\r' and the compare fails. text=auto still lets git
# treat detected binaries as binary.
* text=auto eol=lf
